# A home TV box with Plex, and graphs of it all in Grafana (docs/cookbooks/plex-box.md).
# title: Plex TV box with graphs
# needs: About 2.5 GB more memory, and a free Plex account.
# asks: A playlist named plex, made on the Dashboard; a claim code from plex.tv/claim for Plex's first start; and your media folder (KIA_MEDIA_DIR), unless it's media/ in the kia folder.
# order: 3
KIA_STACK=plex,observability
